I think you missed a step here. You have to point to the cdfenv to use. 
 From the vignette:

comb <- res$cdf     <-- This puts the correct cdfenv into your 					 
.GlobalEnv so rma() can find it.
z <- rma(res$dat)

So I think you need to add

comb95 <- res$cdf

before your call to rma().

