From sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov  Mon Mar 13 22:34:05 2006
From: sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov (Sean Davis)
Date: Mon, 13 Mar 2006 16:34:05 -0500
Subject: [BioC] select one Affy probeset for one gene
